# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo3",
    "password": "4321",
    "mobile": "0854251452",
    "cardId": "1236598754123"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/ac48f290-37cb-4d71-b9da-420fe7dfb41a

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo5",
    "password": "1234"
}